{"artifact_id": "MS-01", "chunk_id": "MS-01:sec:PURPOSE", "content_sha256": "5653cda5a553f62c67ecd0d27feb222244bb50ebbb6d87d99cfaee97c7f59e4f", "heading": "Purpose", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-01", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "# MS-01 — Mark Scheme Structure"}
{"artifact_id": "MS-01", "chunk_id": "MS-01:sec:PURPOSE", "content_sha256": "9fe64690713b2dfb8dfed78204240f26616a57970ba4481cd69b12fcf0717f93", "heading": "Purpose", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-01", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Purpose\n\nThis artifact describes the structure of the 4CH1 mark schemes as they exist in the\nofficial exam corpus of record (SRC-QPMS-4CH1): the embedded per-item \"Mark scheme\nanswer\" blocks, the answer forms per item class, the accepted-alternative guidance\ncolumns and the machine-gradable mark-point lines. It is the opening artifact of the\nMark Scheme Intelligence (MS) family, grounded on the parsed mark-scheme text\nexactly as held — the family law forbids any mark-point inventiveness beyond that\ntext. Every claim is carried on a bounded, locator-addressed excerpt from the run's\nevidence pack. Research artifact; canonical mark_points planes are read-only and\nuntouched."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-01", "chunk_id": "MS-01:sec:SCOPE", "content_sha256": "fa3aa50987ef2f295ff17f6a62bb31e00f4f80e0b33402495fd026a3df8378ab", "heading": "Scope", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-01", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Scope\n\n**Covers:** the per-item block structure; MCQ answer-and-distractor form; mark-point\nlines; ACCEPT/ALLOW guidance; answer forms across item classes; conditional guidance\nrows.\n\n**Grounding:** SRC-QPMS-4CH1 (the 2019-06 and 2020-01 1C papers of the pack —\nmark-scheme text embedded per item in the official extractions).\n\n**Out of scope:** mark-point taxonomy detail (MS-02), alternatives catalogue (MS-04),\nmark-loss semantics (MS-05), examiner language inventory (MS-07)."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-01", "chunk_id": "MS-01:sec:EXECUTIVE_SUMMARY", "content_sha256": "3aaf4af941e6dddb635abd5953311f35b919fa896eff2165a42cab2b204c0ddc", "heading": "Executive Summary", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-01", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Executive Summary\n\nThe parsed mark schemes are per-item, self-contained blocks: an answer line (the\naccepted response, with the MCQ letter where applicable), optional distractor\nrationales (why each wrong option is wrong), an ACCEPT/ALLOW guidance column for\nequivalent forms, and a machine-gradable mark-point line \"- **(1)** ...\" per\nallocatable mark. The structure is uniform enough to parse mechanically — which is\nwhat the corpus of record already does — and rich enough to carry the marking\nnuance (both-must-be-correct conditions, ignore-notes, dependency notes). For\nrevision design, the block structure means every mark a candidate can earn is\nvisible in advance, in the board's own words."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-01", "chunk_id": "MS-01:sec:MAIN_ANALYSIS", "content_sha256": "7fb62975e791ae44ab0c85c87c0d040939264ba410482842e28232986fbe958b", "heading": "Main Analysis", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-01", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Main Analysis"}
{"artifact_id": "MS-01", "chunk_id": "MS-01:sec:EVIDENCE_SOURCE_BASIS", "content_sha256": "dce9dc0f6c6ce469ad3124c13129af61a9ec303868bf4a62b4c27ef27d7baf73", "heading": "Evidence / Source Basis", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-01", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Evidence / Source Basis\n\nPrimary evidence: SRC-QPMS-4CH1 — the 2019-06 and 2020-01 1C official extractions\n(120 bounded line-window excerpts across the two files, locators preserved; the\nmark-scheme text is embedded in the corpus of record and cited verbatim). No\nexaminer reports were consumed for this artifact; no specimen material was cited;\nsupplementary pack sources were not consumed for claims."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-01", "chunk_id": "MS-01:sec:LIMITATIONS_COVERAGE_GAPS", "content_sha256": "b92e1d8bebf19cd20afecab9502c6e6184f1b87693d09434a583c00cdad02f73", "heading": "Limitations / Coverage Gaps", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-01", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Limitations / Coverage Gaps\n\nThe structural description covers the pack's two excerpted papers; the corpus's\nremaining sessions share the same declared schema (each file's header carries the\nofficial-extraction schema line), but structure drift in later sessions is not\naudited here. The artifact describes the parsed text, not the visual layout of the\noriginal PDFs (table grids render as flattened rows in the parse). No canonical\nmark_points plane was read or written."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-01", "chunk_id": "MS-01:sec:RESEARCH_STATUS", "content_sha256": "8aad38ee4b372ccb57a21fad95e355eda2592d03b381174895f58586e388585c", "heading": "Research Status", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-01", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Research Status\n\nGENERATED under SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005 (BL-008 pass 5) from the run's evidence\npack alone; validator of record tools/sib @ 357ace0a; claim QA r3 bound all citations\nto pack excerpts. Research artifact — evidence-backed, not canonical educational\ntruth."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-01", "chunk_id": "MS-01:rec:MS-001", "content_sha256": "7af7d445140db9fe4d3550546f015838b5d80e1967605ad980f95b82c253b998", "heading": "MS-001", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-01", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "MS-001", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "MS-001", "text": "### MS-001 — The embedded per-item block structure\n\n**Claim:** mark-scheme content lives in per-item blocks headed \"**Mark scheme\nanswer**\", directly following each question part in the parsed papers.\n**Evidence:** the 2019-06 1C opening part carries its block immediately after the\nstem and options (SRC-QPMS-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-1C/questions.md lines 19-33), and the\nsame block law governs the 2020-01 papers (SRC-QPMS-4CH1, 2020-01/4CH1-1C/questions.md lines 16-30).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-01", "chunk_id": "MS-01:rec:MS-002", "content_sha256": "da7eca0f4432181b1d5295568b4eac2b4646f821820738259b6b51217ec5586c", "heading": "MS-002", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-01", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "MS-002", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "MS-002", "text": "### MS-002 — The MCQ answer-and-distractor form\n\n**Claim:** MCQ mark schemes print the keyed letter with its content, then give a\nrationale for each rejected distractor.\n**Evidence:** \"> B (the crystal dissolves in water) A is not correct as the crystal\ndoes not condense C is not correct as the crystal does not evaporate D is not\ncorrect as the crystal does not melt\" (SRC-QPMS-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-1C/questions.md lines 19-33); the same form with full-sentence rationales on the appearance item\n(SRC-QPMS-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-1C/questions.md lines 38-52).\n**Design reading:** the distractor rationales are pre-built misconception feedback —\na teaching asset the MIS family can mine without inventing anything.\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-01", "chunk_id": "MS-01:rec:MS-003", "content_sha256": "9466acf3f9b4a30ecbf21ec25b2322ac01314e4c2d41695acdb93c2a4ec52131", "heading": "MS-003", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-01", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "MS-003", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "MS-003", "text": "### MS-003 — The mark-point line as the grading unit\n\n**Claim:** each allocatable mark is printed as its own \"- **(N)**\" line, making the\nmark point the machine-gradable unit of the parsed text.\n**Evidence:** \"- **(1)** Answer B: the crystal dissolves in the water\"\n(SRC-QPMS-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-1C/questions.md lines 19-33); \"- **(1)** T\" on the\nnoble-gas item (SRC-QPMS-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-1C/questions.md lines 105-119).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-01", "chunk_id": "MS-01:rec:MS-004", "content_sha256": "f86caaa265fae448a66d5e5c7614657b4e69bf812dbb5a1f1551054761762f05", "heading": "MS-004", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-01", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "MS-004", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "MS-004", "text": "### MS-004 — ACCEPT/ALLOW guidance for equivalent forms\n\n**Claim:** accepted alternatives ride inside the answer line or an adjacent guidance\ncolumn (ACCEPT for equivalent forms, ALLOW for permitted variants).\n**Evidence:** \"argon / helium ACCEPT Ar / He\" (SRC-QPMS-4CH1, 2020-01/4CH1-1C/questions.md lines 16-30); \"nitrogen ACCEPT N2\"\n(SRC-QPMS-4CH1, 2020-01/4CH1-1C/questions.md lines 27-41).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-01", "chunk_id": "MS-01:rec:MS-005", "content_sha256": "ec29366237e4a66ff6427f648cbdcda3208d11123c327212becefe9eee243d0f", "heading": "MS-005", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-01", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "MS-005", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "MS-005", "text": "### MS-005 — Answer forms across item classes\n\n**Claim:** the answer line's form tracks the item class — a lettered key for MCQs, a\nword or word/formula pair for identification items, a full equation for equation\nitems, a bare number or value for calculation results.\n**Evidence:** the equation item's answer line reads \"> S + O2 → SO2\"\n(SRC-QPMS-4CH1, 2020-01/4CH1-1C/questions.md lines 49-63) and the MCQ key form is\n\"> A (3)\" (SRC-QPMS-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-1C/questions.md lines 81-95).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-01", "chunk_id": "MS-01:rec:MS-006", "content_sha256": "d5a2fc70961519384622a124d82a245c73172f58226a7450e52213dee130ef81", "heading": "MS-006", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-01", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "MS-006", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "MS-006", "text": "### MS-006 — Conditional guidance rows\n\n**Claim:** guidance rows impose conditions on credit — most commonly that a pair of\nanswers must both be correct to score.\n**Evidence:** \"carbon dioxide ACCEPT CO2 If both name and formula given both must be\ncorrect\" (SRC-QPMS-4CH1, 2020-01/4CH1-1C/questions.md lines 38-52) — the same\nconditional law appears across the atmosphere-gas identification series\n(SRC-QPMS-4CH1, 2020-01/4CH1-1C/questions.md lines 16-30).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
